| Closing Bell&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/anthropic-rebounds-from-selloff-closing-bell-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:38:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 抛售中并购维持不变，人工智能信用风险上升</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-deals-11-25-2026-video</link><description>每周一次的中午节目，对塑造全球市场的最重要的企业交易进行高影响力、社论驱动的报道。今天的嘉宾有：Paul Weiss 并购集团全球主席 Robert Kindler、Centerview Partners 合伙人 Gayle Turk、Skadden 合伙人、并购 Brandon Van Dyke 以及 New Mountain Capital 总裁兼首席运营官 Adam Weinstein。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-deals-11-25-2026-video'&gt;抛售中并购维持不变，人工智能信用风险上升&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：M&amp;A Maintains Amid Selloff, AI Credit Risk Rises&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-deals-11-25-2026-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:45:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[路透社] 市长称俄罗斯军队用弹道导弹袭击基辅</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOOUhrdXc0NFhybXpCcmF1VjM2RlFseVBqOW0xdXJBQlZWT0w5TmZRTjFTbEpjWTVlZHBmMHZMQ0tVcm5OMnk5RjhKWklxQlFfY1hDQTB4dmZNQWwwd2tLb0xLNGRNbUpNXzNCZGw0Sm1fNlhkSEUzNUZvQ2hkVHNOMGhOOFJlSnZJcXQ4UldFb01FY2J2YmpLUW1NTi1rWnRBb3c?oc=5</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[路透社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOOUhrdXc0NFhybXpCcmF1VjM2RlFseVBqOW0xdXJBQlZWT0w5TmZRTjFTbEpjWTVlZHBmMHZMQ0tVcm5OMnk5RjhKWklxQlFfY1hDQTB4dmZNQWwwd2tLb0xLNGRNbUpNXzNCZGw0Sm1fNlhkSEUzNUZvQ2hkVHNOMGhOOFJlSnZJcXQ4UldFb01FY2J2YmpLUW1NTi1rWnRBb3c?oc=5'&gt;市长称俄罗斯军队用弹道导弹袭击基辅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russian forces hit Kyiv with ballistic missiles, mayor says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOOUhrdXc