olitics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html</link><description>最近几天股市的回落表明，特朗普总统推动重新任命公司首席执行官的努力与他其他政策的现实发生了冲突。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html'&gt;特朗普对市场上英伟达的飙升感到高兴。它并没有持续多久。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump Rejoiced in the Market’s Nvidia Surge. It Didn’t Last Long.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:35:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 英伟达创始人复出，台湾和中国掀起“Jensanity”热潮</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/368c4526-a0ce-4951-a847-f039af2a51af?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>黄仁勋是少数横跨海峡两岸的商界领袖之一&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/368c4526-a0ce-4951-a847-f039af2a51af?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;英伟达创始人复出，台湾和中国掀起“Jensanity”热潮&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：‘Jensanity’ erupts in Taiwan and China on Nvidia founder’s comeback&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/368c4526-a0ce-4951-a847-f039af2a51af?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:45:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 美国因人工智能风险而交易波动，亚洲股市上涨</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/6e217409-9fbb-456c-b405-2eb15bb69679</link><description>由于担心人工智能热潮能否持续，科技股本月下跌&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/6e217409-9fbb-456c-b405-2eb15bb69679'&gt;美国因人工智能风险而交易波动，亚洲股市上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks advance in Asia after volatile US trading over AI risks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/6e217409-9fbb-456c-b405-2eb15bb69679</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:57:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC等2家] 韩国加息至两年来最高水平，通胀仍高于目标</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/bok-rate-decision-korea-gdp-inflation.html</link><description>央行在今年最后一次会议上将利率提高 25 个基点至 3.25%，符合经济学家的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 2 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/bok-rate-decision-korea-gdp-inflation.html'&gt;韩国加息至两年来最高水平，通胀仍高于目标&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：South Korea raises rates to highest in two years, as inflation remains above target&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/823af978-e22b-49a4-a2a1-52867a6520fa'&gt;韩国央行在人工智能芯片热潮中加息&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bank of Korea raises interest rates amid AI chip boom&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/bok-rate-decision-korea-gdp-inflation.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:58:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 莫迪对印度公司的批评使投资疲软成为焦点</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/modi-s-criticism-of-india-inc-puts-weak-investment-in-focus</link><description>总理纳伦德拉·莫迪上周对印度企业的尖锐批评暴露了经济蓬勃发展的潜在弱点。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/modi-s-criticism-of-india-inc-puts-weak-investment-in-focus'&gt;莫迪对印度公司的批评使投资疲软成为焦点&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Modi’s Criticism of India Inc. Puts Weak Investment in Focus&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/modi-s-criticism-of-india-inc-puts-weak-investment-in-focus</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 澳大利亚资本支出自数据中心采矿热潮以来大幅飙升</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers</link><description>受数据中心相关支出的推动，澳大利亚商业投资出现了自截至 9 月份采矿业繁荣顶峰以来的最大涨幅，这为原本降温的经济带来了亮点。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers'&gt;澳大利亚资本支出自数据中心采矿热潮以来大幅飙升&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Capex Surges by Most Since Mining Boom on Data Centers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-capex-surges-by-most-since-mining-boom-on-data-centers</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:01:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 卢拉提议布拉德斯科的路易斯·特拉布科加入他的政府</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government</link><description>据知情人士透露，总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦已向布拉德斯科主席路易斯·卡洛斯·特拉布科·卡皮试探加入其第四届政府，此举可能有助于缓解投资者对巴西不断恶化的财政前景的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government'&gt;卢拉提议布拉德斯科的路易斯·特拉布科加入他的政府&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Lula Sounds Out Bradesco’s Luiz Trabuco to Join His Government&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/lula-sounds-out-bradesco-s-luiz-trabuco-to-join-his-government</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:07:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 对冲基金不再只是富人的专利。他们是为日常投资者而来</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/hedge-funds-retail-investors.html</link><description>随着该行业寻求新的增长途径，对冲基金越来越多地吸引散户投资者。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/hedge-funds-retail-investors.html'&gt;对冲基金不再只是富人的专利。他们是为日常投资者而来&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hedge funds are no longer just for the rich. They’re coming for everyday investors&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/hedge-funds-retail-investors.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:10:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 《华尔街日报》称，第三季度态势感知能力下降了 65%</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/situational-awareness-ai-65-hedge-fund-third-quarter-wsj-says</link><description>据《华尔街日报》报道，Situational Awareness 告诉投资者，在对人工智能公司的高杠杆押注几乎导致该对冲基金 7 月份破产后，该公司第三季度扣除费用后损失了 65%。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/situational-awareness-ai-65-hedge-fund-third-quarter-wsj-says'&gt;《华尔街日报》称，第三季度态势感知能力下降了 65%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Situational Awareness Lost 65% in Wild Third Quarter, WSJ Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/situational-awareness-ai-65-hedge-fund-third-quarter-wsj-says</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:11:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 策略师表示，在印度央行介入之前，卢比还有上涨空间</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-rally-has-91-in-sight-as-rbi-seen-holding-back-dollar-buys</link><description>印度卢比正在脱离其亚洲货币，策略师表示，在央行介入购买美元之前，卢比的涨势还会进一步扩大。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-rally-has-91-in-sight-as-rbi-seen-holding-back-dollar-buys'&gt;策略师表示，在印度央行介入之前，卢比还有上涨空间&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rupee Has Room to Rally Before RBI Steps In, Strategists Say&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-rally-has-91-in-sight-as-rbi-seen-holding-back-dollar-buys</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Shein 在印度的缓慢起步暴露了亿万富翁安巴尼零售实力的局限性</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/shein-s-slow-india-start-lays-bare-limits-of-billionaire-ambani-s-retail-might</link><description>Shein Global Holdings Ltd. 通过当地合作伙伴重返印度的计划起步缓慢，原因是供应链障碍、领导层的不确定性以及缺乏使这个快时尚品牌大受欢迎的专有技术。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/shein-s-slow-india-start-lays-bare-limits-of-billionaire-ambani-s-retail-might'&gt;Shein 在印度的缓慢起步暴露了亿万富翁安巴尼零售实力的局限性&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Shein’s Slow India Start Lays Bare Limits of Billionaire Ambani’s Retail Might&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/shein-s-slow-india-start-lays-bare-limits-of-billionaire-ambani-s-retail-might</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:31:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</link><description>尽管人们对人工智能繁荣和相关工业金属需求的持久性仍存疑虑，但铜价从 11 个月低点上涨逾 3%，追随科技股的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals'&gt;由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Rebounds From Lowest This Year as Volatility Hits Metals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:01:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] KK Mart 启动 1.12 亿美元的 IPO，因马来西亚 Socks Row 推迟</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kk-mart-starts-112-million-ipo-delayed-by-malaysia-socks-row</link><description>马来西亚连锁便利店 KK Mart Retail Bhd. 由于宗教争议而推迟了首次公开募股，该公司正在启动 4.62 亿林吉特（1.12 亿美元）的股票发售，准备在全国增加数百家门店。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kk-mart-starts-112-million-ipo-delayed-by-malaysia-socks-row'&gt;KK Mart 启动 1.12 亿美元的 IPO，因马来西亚 Socks Row 推迟&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：KK Mart Starts $112 Million IPO Delayed by Malaysia Socks Row&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/kk-mart-starts-112-million-ipo-delayed-by-malaysia-socks-row</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:03:11 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>